<li class="ltx_tocentry ltx_tocentry_subsection"><a href="#S5.SS4" title="In 5 Experiments and Results ‣ Scale Can’t Overcome Pragmatics: The Impact of Reporting Bias on Vision-Language Reasoning" class="ltx_ref"><span class="ltx_text ltx_ref_title"><span class="ltx_tag ltx_tag_ref">5.4 </span>Adding Captions from Other Languages</span></a></li>
<li class="ltx_tocentry ltx_tocentry_subsection"><a href="#S5.SS5" title="In 5 Experiments and Results ‣ Scale Can’t Overcome Pragmatics: The Impact of Reporting Bias on Vision-Language Reasoning" class="ltx_ref"><span class="ltx_text ltx_ref_title"><span class="ltx_tag ltx_tag_ref">5.5 </span>Closed-Data Generative Models</span></a></li>
</ol></li>
<li class="ltx_tocentry ltx_tocentry_section"><a href="#S6" title="In Scale Can’t Overcome Pragmatics: The Impact of Reporting Bias on Vision-Language Reasoning" class="ltx_ref"><span class="ltx_text ltx_ref_title"><span class="ltx_tag ltx_tag_ref">6 </span>Leveraging Annotator Instructions Can Mitigate Reporting Bias</span></a>
<ol class="ltx_toclist ltx_toclist_section">
<li class="ltx_tocentry ltx_tocentry_subsection"><a href="#S6.SS1" title="In 6 Leveraging Annotator Instructions Can Mitigate Reporting Bias ‣ Scale Can’t Overcome Pragmatics: The Impact of Reporting Bias on Vision-Language Reasoning" class="ltx_ref"><span class="ltx_text ltx_ref_title"><span class="ltx_tag ltx_tag_ref">6.1 </span>Impact of Annotator Instructions on Reporting Bias in Existing Datasets</span></a></li>
<li class="ltx_tocentry ltx_tocentry_subsection"><a href="#S6.SS2" title="In 6 Leveraging Annotator Instructions Can Mitigate Reporting Bias ‣ Scale Can’t Overcome Pragmatics: The Impact of Reporting Bias on Vision-Language Reasoning" class="ltx_ref"><span class="ltx_text ltx_ref_title"><span class="ltx_tag ltx_tag_ref">6.2 </span>User Study to Mitigate Reporting Bias with Annotator Instructions</span></a></li>
<li class="ltx_tocentry ltx_tocentry_subsection"><a href="#S6.SS3" title="In 6 Leveraging Annotator Instructions Can Mitigate Reporting Bias ‣ Scale Can’t Overcome Pragmatics: The Impact of Reporting Bias on Vision-Language Reasoning" class="ltx_ref"><span class="ltx_text ltx_ref_title"><span class="ltx_tag ltx_tag_ref">6.3 </span>Does Our Method Sufficiently Mitigate Reporting Bias?</span></a></li>
<li class="ltx_tocentry ltx_tocentry_subsection"><a href="#S6.SS4" title="In 6 Leveraging Annotator Instructions Can Mitigate Reporting Bias ‣ Scale Can’t Overcome Pragmatics: The Impact of Reporting Bias on Vision-Language Reasoning" class="ltx_ref"><span class="ltx_text ltx_ref_title"><span class="ltx_tag ltx_tag_ref">6.4 </span>Implications for Data Collection Methods</span></a>
<ol class="ltx_toclist ltx_toclist_subsection">
<li class="ltx_tocentry ltx_tocentry_paragraph"><a href="#S6.SS4.SSS0.Px1" title="In 6.4 Implications for Data Collection Methods ‣ 6 Leveraging Annotator Instructions Can Mitigate Reporting Bias ‣ Scale Can’t Overcome Pragmatics: The Impact of Reporting Bias on Vision-Language Reasoning" class="ltx_ref"><span class="ltx_text ltx_ref_title">Reasoning <span class="ltx_text ltx_font_italic">can</span> be elicited from annotators.</span></a></li>
<li class="ltx_tocentry ltx_tocentry_paragraph"><a href="#S6.SS4.SSS0.Px2" title="In 6.4 Implications for Data Collection Methods ‣ 6 Leveraging Annotator Instructions Can Mitigate Reporting Bias ‣ Scale Can’t Overcome Pragmatics: The Impact of Reporting Bias on Vision-Language Reasoning" class="ltx_ref"><span class="ltx_text ltx_ref_title">Instructions to prevent reporting bias do not generalize across types of reasoning.</span></a></li>
<li class="ltx_tocentry ltx_tocentry_paragraph"><a href="#S6.SS4.SSS0.Px3" title="In 6.4 Implications for Data Collection Methods ‣ 6 Leveraging Annotator Instructions Can Mitigate Reporting Bias ‣ Scale Can’t Overcome Pragmatics: The Impact of Reporting Bias on Vision-Language Reasoning" class="ltx_ref"><span class="ltx_text ltx_ref_title">Reporting bias can’t be circumvented with caption length alone.</span></a></li>
<li class="ltx_tocentry ltx_tocentry_paragraph"><a href="#S6.SS4.SSS0.Px4" title="In 6.4 Implications for Data Collection Methods ‣ 6 Leveraging Annotator Instructions Can Mitigate Reporting Bias ‣ Scale Can’t Overcome Pragmatics: The Impact of Reporting Bias on Vision-Language Reasoning" class="ltx_ref"><span class="ltx_text ltx_ref_title">Reporting bias does impact model performance.</span></a></li>
<li class="ltx_tocentry ltx_tocentry_paragraph"><a href="#S6.SS4.SSS0.Px5" title="In 6.4 Implications for Data Collection Methods ‣ 6 Leveraging Annotator Instructions Can Mitigate Reporting Bias ‣ Scale Can’t Overcome Pragmatics: The Impact of Reporting Bias on Vision-Language Reasoning" class="ltx_ref"><span class="ltx_text ltx_ref_title">Reporting bias occurs in LLM-synthesized data too!</span></a></li>
</ol></li>
</ol></li>
<li class="ltx_tocentry ltx_tocentry_section"><a href="#S7" title="In Scale Can’t Overcome Pragmatics: The Impact of Reporting Bias on Vision-Language Reasoning" class="ltx_ref"><span class="ltx_text ltx_ref_title"><span class="ltx_tag ltx_tag_ref">7 </span>Conclusion and Future Work</span></a></li>
<li class="ltx_tocentry ltx_tocentry_bibliography"><a href="#bib" title="In Scale Can’t Overcome Pragmatics: The Impact of Reporting Bias on Vision-Language Reasoning" class="ltx_ref"><span class="ltx_text ltx_ref_title">References</span></a></li>
<li class="ltx_tocentry ltx_tocentry_appendix"><a href="#A1" title="In Scale Can’t Overcome Pragmatics: The Impact of Reporting Bias on Vision-Language Reasoning" class="ltx_ref"><span class="ltx_text ltx_ref_title"><span class="ltx_tag ltx_tag_ref">A </span>Appendix</span></a>
